<title>NETHERLANDS: KNP BT Q1 net from ord ops rises slightly.</title>
<headline>KNP BT Q1 net from ord ops rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr 1997</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per share (guilders)		 0.42  vs    0.40</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops	  52     vs   50</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 122     vs  130</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			3.71  vs    3.41</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected Dutch paper, office equipment and printing machinery group NV Koninklijke KNP BT to post a first quarter net from ordinary operations of between 40 and 48 million guilders.</p>
</text>
